communication technologies that include computer,", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[41, 558], [1186, 560], [1186, 593], [41, 591]]}, {"text": "software,datacommunication,computernetworks,Internet,cellphones,etc.", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[70, 609], [1136, 608], [1136, 638], [70, 639]]}, {"text": " History of computers can be divided into five generations based on the", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[55, 654], [1187, 652], [1187, 688], [55, 690]]}, {"text": "technology used. Vacuum tubes, transistors, IC's chip and microprocessors", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[70, 705], [1186, 701], [1186, 733], [70, 737]]}, {"text": "respectively.. Fifth generation of computers is based on Artificial Intelligence", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[68, 798], [1187, 791], [1187, 826], [69, 833]]}, {"text": "(AI).", "conf": 0.743, "box": [[68, 843], [136, 843], [136, 884], [68, 884]]}, {"text": "ICT devices are used in our daily life. Some important applications of ICT include", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[65, 894], [1187, 887], [1187, 924], [65, 931]]}, {"text": "application in communication, measurement, industry and business.", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[69, 942], [1018, 935], [1019, 971], [70, 979]]}, {"text": "Computer system consists of two components, hardware and software.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[69, 991], [1184, 982], [1184, 1015], [70, 1023]]}, {"text": "Hardware refers to physical parts of computer such as keyboard, mouse, CPU,", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[69, 1037], [1186, 1029], [1186, 1065], [70, 1073]]}, {"text": "hard disk, etc. Software refers to computer programs such as Microsoft", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[68, 1082], [1190, 1077], [1190, 1117], [68, 1122]]}, {"text": "Windows,Word,3DPaint,etc.", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[74, 1133], [478, 1133], [478, 1163], [74, 1163]]}, {"text": "Input devices are used to enter data and instructions into the computer. Some", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[66, 1180], [1187, 1175], [1187, 1210], [66, 1216]]}, {"text": "commonly usedinput devices are keyboard, mouse, microphone and scanner.", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[71, 1229], [1138, 1225], [1138, 1258], [72, 1262]]}, {"text": "Output devices are used to show the results of data processing. Some commonly", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[49, 1275], [1185, 1273], [1185, 1307], [49, 1309]]}, {"text": "used output devices are display screen, printer and speaker.", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[68, 1323], [890, 1321], [890, 1358], [68, 1360]]}, {"text": "Computer memory is divided into RAM and ROM. RAM temporarily stores data", "conf": 0.95, "box": [[51, 1371], [1184, 1369], [1184, 1402], [51, 1404]]}, {"text": "Storage devices such as hard disk, flash drive and memory cards are used to", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[52, 1513], [1184, 1513], [1184, 1543], [52, 1543]]}, {"text": "permanently store data and programs. These devices have large storage capacity.", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[69, 1559], [1181, 1559], [1181, 1595], [69, 1595]]}, {"text": "14", "conf": 0.584, "box": [[605, 1657], [643, 1657], [643, 1686], [605, 1686]]}, {"text": "Unit 1: ICT Fundamentals", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[757, 1662], [980, 1665], [979, 1689], [757, 1686]]}]}